{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 118,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh give thanks unto Jehovah; for he is good;\nFor his lovingkindness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "endureth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let Israel now say,\nThat his lovingkindness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "endureth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let the house of Aaron now say,\nThat his lovingkindness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "endureth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let them now that fear Jehovah say,\nThat his lovingkindness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "endureth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Out of my distress I called upon Jehovah:Jehovah answered me ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and set me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in a large place.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah is on my side; I will not fear:\nWhat can man do unto me?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah is on my side among them that help me:\nTherefore shall I see ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my desire",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon them that hate me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It is better to take refuge in Jehovah\nThan to put confidence in man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It is better to take refuge in Jehovah\nThan to put confidence in princes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All nations compassed me about:\nIn the name of Jehovah I will cut them off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They compassed me about; yea, they compassed me about:\nIn the name of Jehovah I will cut them off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They compassed me about like bees;\nthey are quenched as the fire of thorns:\nIn the name of Jehovah I will cut them off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou didst thrust sore at me that I might fall;\nBut Jehovah helped me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah is my strength and song;\nAnd he is become my salvation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The voice of rejoicing and salvation is in the tents of the righteous:\nThe right hand of Jehovah doeth valiantly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The right hand of Jehovah is exalted:\nThe right hand of Jehovah doeth valiantly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I shall not die, but live,\nAnd declare the works of Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah hath chastened me sore;\nBut he hath not given me over unto death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Open to me the gates of righteousness:\nI will enter into them, I will give thanks unto Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This is the gate of Jehovah;\nThe righteous shall enter into it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will give thanks unto thee; for thou hast answered me,\nAnd art become my salvation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The stone which the builders rejected\nIs become the head of the corner.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This is Jehovah’s doing;\nIt is marvellous in our eyes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This is the day which Jehovah hath made;\nWe will rejoice and be glad in it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Save now, we beseech thee, O Jehovah:\nO Jehovah, we beseech thee, send now prosperity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed be he that cometh in the name of Jehovah:\nWe have blessed you out of the house of Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah is God, and he hath given us light:\nBind the sacrifice with cords, even unto the horns of the altar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou art my God, and I will give thanks unto thee:\nThou art my God, I will exalt thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.118.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.118.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh give thanks unto Jehovah; for he is good;\nFor his lovingkindness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "endureth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Thanksgiving for Jehovah’s saving goodness.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
